,"org_ins_type":"College","activitytype":"Experiential learning,Volunteer","is_nyf":0,"org_photo":"logo_ec44c59d-a2f0-4c67-8245-f5b5196dce4b.jpeg","org_banner":"banner_42adac95-5bc5-42fb-a446-b7c400714a11.jpeg","org_about":"<p>Bherulal Patidar Government P. G. College, MHOW is a Govt. Affiliated college catering tothe need of higher education irrespective of gender in rural area of Malwa Plateau.The College, started in the premises of K.B.E.P. School, MHOW and was later upgraded as Govt. Degree College in 1958 with the dedication of a handful of local people as its patron.<br><br>With vertical academic growth of the College, it is now a centre of multi-faculty courses. In 2007 the College was accredited by NAAC with the Grade \u201cB+\u201d &amp; II cycle in 2017 Grade \u201cA\u201d .<br><br>At present, this College holds its head high and stands as the only Govt.College in MHOW tehsil catering to the vast tribal, scheduled caste and other backward caste populations across gender.<br>The College offers a variety of courses at different levels ranging from Arts, Science, Home Science &amp; Commerce.<\/p>","slug":"bherulal-patider-govt-pg-college-mhow","org_state_id":19,"org_district_id":387,"org_block_id":null,"org_type":"Knowledge Institutions","specialization":[],"created_on":"2026-06-19 10:05:04","updated_on":"2026-06-19 13:32:31","org_state_name":"Madhya Pradesh","org_district_name":"Indore","org_block_name":"","events":{"count":0,"data":[]},"elos":{"count":0,"data":[]}},{"org_id":140400,"org_name":"SRI AUROBINDO INSTITUTE OF PHARMACY","orgtype_id":3,"org_tagging":"College","org_ins_type":"College","activitytype":"Experiential learning,Volunteer","is_nyf":0,"org_photo":"logo_9166e080-c107-42be-87b1-b150ee458e3c.jpeg","org_banner":"banner_e32d838b-0e0c-4b6f-beef-095318c4512d.png","org_about":"<p>Sri Aurobindo Institute of Pharmacy was started in the year 2009 with a clear intent to make the institute the best seat of learning in pharmacy education.<\/p><p>Established in 2009, Sri Aurobindo Institute of Pharmacy (SAIP) has rapidly emerged as a leading institution dedicated to excellence in pharmacy education. With a mission to nurture future pharmacists through quality education, SAIP is recognized as a premier pharmacy institute in central India.<\/p>","slug":"sri-aurobindo-institute-of-pharmacy","org_state_id":19,"org_district_id":387,"org_block_id":null,"org_type":"Knowledge Institutions","specialization":[9],"created_on":"2026-06-01 17:49:50","updated_on":"2026-06-19 13:32:48","org_state_name":"Madhya Pradesh","org_district_name":"Indore","org_block_name":"","events":{"count":1,"data":[{"id":163609,"user_id":74090102,"event_name":"SANKALP 2047 Yoga for Viksit Bharat 2047 Healthy Youth. Strong Nation. Developed India.","description":"<p>The International Day of Yoga is celebrated globally every year on 21st June to recognize the invaluable contribution of Yoga towards physical, mental, emotional, and spiritual well-being. Since its adoption by the United Nations, Yoga has emerged as a powerful global movement promoting harmony between mind, body, and nature while encouraging preventive healthcare and healthy lifestyles.<\/p><p>In alignment with the vision of Viksit Bharat 2047 and the initiatives of the Ministry of AYUSH, Government of India, Sri Aurobindo Institute of Pharmacy proposes to organize SANKALP 2047 \u2013 Yoga for Viksit Bharat 2047 as a comprehensive wellness and nation-building initiative. The programme is designed to integrate Yoga, Meditation, Yoga Nidra, Sound Healing, Mental Wellness, Sustainable Living, and Community Participation activities to promote holistic health and responsible citizenship among students, faculty members, healthcare professionals, and society at large.<\/p><p>As part of the national celebration, the institute shall actively participate in the Guinness World Record Attempt through a Live Online Yoga Session organized by the Ministry of AYUSH on 14 June 2026. Further, the institute 