ssociation with <b>Isha Foundation<\/b>, is organizing <b>\u201cMiracle of Mind Session<\/b>\u201d, a 40-minute guided session introducing a simple 7-minute daily meditation that can be practiced anytime, anywhere to build focus, energy, and calm. <b>The objective is to improve students\u2019 academic performance, memory retention, stress management, and day-to-day productivity across classes, projects, and exams, while promoting a healthier, balanced campus environment.<\/b> The event is free and open to all students on 10 October 2025 at the Auditoriums of SISTec-E and SISTec-R, with two tentative slots: 10:00\u201311:00 and 11:30\u201312:30; additional batches may be added based on registrations.\u00a0<\/p>","numer_of_days":null,"event_from_date":"2025-10-10","event_to_date":"2025-10-10","last_rsvp_date":null,"state_id":19,"city_id":373,"block_id":0,"image_path":"68e79e42cca46138190.jpg","eventHighlights":null,"event_address":"SISTec-R, Sikenderabad, Ratibad","specialization":"66","nyf_category":0,"nyf_activity_type":null,"nyf_component_type":null,"org_id":121600,"created_at":"2025-10-09 11:36:34","state":"Madhya Pradesh","district":"Bhopal","nyf_category_name":"","getnyfeventactivity":[],"getnyfeventcomponent":[]},{"id":134045,"user_id":70570252,"event_name":"Eco-Ganesh Faith with Nature \u2013 Idol Making Activity","description":"<p>The NSS Unit of SISTec-R is organizing an Eco-Ganesh Idol Making Workshop under the theme: <b>\u201cLord Ganesh is Vighnaharta (remover of obstacles)<\/b>. By making idols with <b>seeds \/ herbal clay<\/b>, we are helping Him remove pollution obstacles and bless the environment.\u201d<\/p><p>This activity aims to promote eco-friendly celebrations of Ganesh Chaturthi by preparing idols using clay, cow dung powder, herbal powders, and seeds. These idols, when immersed, will dissolve harmlessly and nurture the environment by enriching the soil or growing into plants.<\/p><p>Details of the Activity \r\n<\/p><p>\uf0b7 Event Name: Eco-Ganesh: Faith with Nature; Date: 26th August, 2025 \r\n<\/p><p>\uf0b7 Time: 01:00 PM \u2013 04:00 PM; Venue: Celebrations, SISTec-R \r\n<\/p><p>Objectives:<\/p><p>1. To promote eco-friendly celebrations of Ganesh Chaturthi. \r\n<\/p><p>2. To spread awareness about the harmful effects of POP idols on water bodies. \r\n<\/p><p>3. To blend spirituality with sustainability by making seed-embedded idols.<\/p>","numer_of_days":null,"event_from_date":"2025-08-26","event_to_date":"2025-08-26","last_rsvp_date":null,"state_id":19,"city_id":373,"block_id":0,"image_path":"68d6451a1fee2134045.jpg","eventHighlights":null,"event_address":"SISTec-R, Sikenderabad, Ratibad","specialization":"9","nyf_category":0,"nyf_activity_type":null,"nyf_component_type":null,"org_id":121600,"created_at":"2025-09-26 07:47:38","state":"Madhya Pradesh","district":"Bhopal","nyf_category_name":"","getnyfeventactivity":[],"getnyfeventcomponent":[]},{"id":134020,"user_id":70570252,"event_name":"Mega Blood Donation Camp","description":"<p>The NSS Unit of SISTec-R, in association with the Red Ribbon Club and Sagar Multispecialty Hospital, is organizing a Mega Blood Donation Camp on 17th September as part of the district-wide Swasth Nari Sashakt Parivar Abhiyan.<\/p><p>\ud83e\ude78 Date: 17th Sep. 2025\r\n<\/p><p>\ud83d\udccd Venue: SISTec-R<\/p><p>\u23f0 Time: 12:30 PM-05:00 PM<\/p><p>Why Participation Matters<\/p><p>Blood donation is not just a simple act\u2014it is a powerful gift that saves lives. Every two seconds, someone in India needs blood to survive an emergency, surgery, or chronic illness. By donating blood at the Mega Blood Donation Camp, you become a real-life hero, giving hope and health to those in urgent need.\u00a0<\/p><p>Importance of Blood Donation<\/p><p>- One unit of blood can save up to three lives.\u00a0\u00a0<\/p><p>- It supports critical medical treatments for accident victims, cancer patients, mothers during childbirth, and people with blood disorders like thalassemia.\u00a0\u00a0<\/p><p>- Blood cannot be manufactured; it can only be gifted by generous donors like you.<\/p><p>Join Us<\/p><p>Donate Blood. Save Lives. Empower Families.<\/p><p>\r\n<\/p><p>\r\n<\/p><p>\r\n<\/p><p>\r\n<\/p>","numer_of_days":null,"event_from_date":"2025-09-17","event_to_date":"2025-09-17","last_rsvp_date":null,"state_id":19,"city_id":373,"block_id":0,"image_path":"68d63e4027040134020.jpeg","eventHighlights":null,"event_address":"SISTec-R, Sikenderabad, Ratibad","specialization":"11","nyf_category":0,"nyf_activity_type":null,"nyf_component_type":null,"org_id":121600,"created_at":"2025-09-26 07:18:24","state":"Madhya Pradesh","district":"Bhopal","nyf_category_name":"","getnyfeventactivity":[],"getnyfeventcomponent":[]}]},"elos":{"count":0,"data":[]}},{"org_id":121535,"org_name":"Shivajirao Kadam Institute of Pharmaceutical Education and Research Indore","orgtype_id":3,"org_tagging":"College","org_ins_type":"College","activitytype":"Experiential learning,Volunteer","is_nyf":0,"org_photo":"logo_e3a6181b-8aad-410c-89ab-c183fb4ee584.png","org_banner":"banner_38eb975e-c8c1-4342-bd3f-387c936bdd31.jpeg","org_about":"<p><i><strong>Shivajirao Kadam Institute of Pharmaceutical Education and Research<\/strong><\/i><strong> has been established by Transnational Knowledge Society and promoted by Shivajirao Kadam Group of Institutions with the mission to set up the institute with academic excellence by imparting education through high-quality infrastructure and technologies in pharmaceutical sciences. The vision of our Institute is to become an eminent institute by providing excellent pharmaceutical education and research to improve healthcare needs of Community and Technological aspects of industries. The Institute provide professional environment and develop pharmacy professionals as responsible citizens of a society with ethical values. The Institute is committed to develop Skills to create innovation and bring the transformation among the young minds to become global leader in p